sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant KP as TextPageKeymap
    participant RP as run-page-script
    participant SR as ScriptRunner
    participant SC as ScriptContext
    participant AW as AppWrapper
    participant PW as PageWrapper
    participant F as EditorFacade
    participant EM as EditorModel
    participant GP as Grouped Page

    U->>KP: Press F5
    KP->>RP: run page script
    RP->>RP: Determine script source
    Note right of RP: Script panel open?<br/>-> run panel content<br/>JS file + no panel?<br/>-> run page content/selection

    RP->>SR: runWithResult(pageId, script, page)
    SR->>SC: new ScriptContext(page)

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over SC,PW: Context Creation
        SC->>SC: releaseList = []
        SC->>AW: new AppWrapper(releaseList)
        AW->>AW: Wrap app singleton
        SC->>PW: new PageWrapper(model, releaseList)
        PW->>PW: Wrap EditorModel → IPage

        SC->>SC: Build context properties
        Note right of SC: app, page, io, ai,<br/>customRequire, console,<br/>lazy ui getter
    end

    SC-->>SR: ScriptContext

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over SR,GP: Script Execution
        SR->>SR: Wrap script in async function
        Note right of SR: fn.call(context)<br/>SCRIPT_PREFIX reads from `this`<br/>+ implicit return

        SR->>SR: Execute script

        Note over PW,EM: Script accesses page.content
        SR->>PW: page.content (getter)
        PW-->>SR: model.contentHost.state.get().content

        Note over PW,EM: Script reads page.editor
        SR->>PW: page.editor (getter)
        PW->>F: facade for mainEditor<br/>(GridEditorFacade here)
        Note right of F: Stateless wrapper —<br/>no acquire/release
        F-->>SR: IEditorFacade (id: "grid-json")

        Note over F: Script uses facade
        SR->>F: facade.addRows(5)
        F->>EM: gridEditor.addRows(5)

        Note over PW,GP: Script accesses page.grouped
        SR->>PW: page.grouped.content = result
        PW->>PW: Auto-create grouped page
        PW->>GP: new PageWrapper(grouped, releaseList)
        GP->>GP: changeContent(result)
    end

    SR->>SR: await result (if Promise)
    SR->>SR: convertToText(result)
    Note right of SR: object → JSON<br/>string → as-is<br/>Error → stack trace

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over SR,SC: Cleanup (always runs)
        SR->>SC: context.dispose()
        SC->>SC: Iterate releaseList
        Note right of SC: Unsubscribe event handlers<br/>from app.events.* subscriptions
        SC->>SC: Restore previous ui getter
    end

    SR->>GP: Write result to grouped page
    SR-->>RP: result string
